            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4p's Vincom 3 Thang 2",
            "review_text": "Q Nguyen\nChicago, Illinois13 contributions\n0\nSolid Neapolitan Pizza in the Heart of Saigon\nJan 2026 • Family\nPizza 4P at Vincom 3/2 Street understands what it is, and that's refreshing. This is a chain doing proper Neapolitan pizza in Saigon, and they do it well.\n\nThe pizza is genuinely good. The crust has that authentic Neapolitan character, with the right char and chew that tells you the kitchen takes this seriously. It's a step below the absolute best Neapolitan I've had, but that's less a criticism of Pizza 4P and more a reflection of what happens when a restaurant expands. Maintaining the obsessive consistency of a single-location specialty spot is nearly impossible at scale, yet they've managed to keep things remarkably solid. If you're craving legitimate Neapolitan pizza without needing it to be a life-changing meal, this is exactly where you want to be.\n\nThe pasta is also worth ordering. It's prepared with the same straightforward competence as the pizza, nothing revolutionary but solidly executed.\n\nThe specialty pizzas are more of a mixed bag. Whether they land depends on how much you value local ingredients and innovation versus strict tradition. Some of the house creations work beautifully, others feel like they're trying too hard to adapt to local tastes. It's worth exploring, but go in knowing that not every special will be a hit.\nService was good, attentive without being intrusive.\n\nFor a chain in Saigon, Pizza 4P delivers on its promise: quality Neapolitan pizza in a convenient location. That's worth the visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 14, 2026\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr./Ms. Q Nguyen,\n\nThank you very much for taking the time to share your experience at Pizza 4P’s Vincom 3/2.\nWe truly appreciate your detailed and thoughtful feedback. It is encouraging to hear that you enjoyed our Neapolitan pizza and pasta, and that our service met your expectations. Your recognition of our efforts to maintain quality and consistency across our restaurants is especially meaningful to our team.\n\nYour comments motivate us to continue refining our food and service so we can deliver the best possible experience to our guests. We also value your perspective on our specialty pizzas and will certainly take it into consideration as we continue to develop our menu.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon.\nWishing you a wonderful day,\nPizza 4P’s Team\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
