            "review_text": "Cuong Tran\nSterling, Virginia143 contributions\n0\nGood food\nNov 2025 • Friends\nHad a great experience at Pizza 4P’s. Thanks to Duyên, she was friendly, attentive, and made our meal feel really comfortable. The food was great, and her service made it even better. Highly recommend!\nWritten November 23, 2025\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr./Ms. Cuong Tran,\n\nThank you so much for visiting Pizza 4P’s and for taking the time to share your wonderful experience with us at Pizza 4P's Vincom 3/2.\nWe are delighted to hear that you enjoyed your meal and that our staff helped make your visit even more comfortable and enjoyable. Your kind words mean a lot to us, and we will be sure to pass along your appreciation to her. She will be very happy to know her service made a positive impact.\n\nOnce again, thank you for your recommendation. We truly look forward to welcoming you back for another great experience soon.\n\nWarm regards,\nPizza 4P’s Team\nRead more\nWritten November 24, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
